---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { methodologyServices } from '../../data/methodology';
import Button from '../Button.astro';
---

<section class="chapter methodology-section" id="metodologia" aria-labelledby="methodology-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading methodology-heading reveal-up">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker"><span></span>METODOLOGIA ALFABI</p>
        <h2 id="methodology-title">Aprender com confiança.<br><span class="text-outline">Crescer com acolhimento.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>Cada criança tem seu jeito de aprender. Na Alfabi, unimos acompanhamento pedagógico, experiências significativas e acolhimento para apoiar cada etapa dessa jornada.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="methodology-grid">
      {methodologyServices.map((service, index) => (
        <article class="methodology-card hover-glow reveal-up" data-reveal-delay={index * 70} style={`--card-accent:var(--brand-${service.color});--card-tint:${service.tint}`}>
          <div class={`methodology-image methodology-image--${service.color}`}>
            <Image src={service.image} width={service.image.width} height={service.image.height}
              alt={service.alt} loading="lazy" widths={[200, 320, 440, 640]}
              sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 210px, (min-width: 900px) 28vw, (min-width: 600px) 42vw, 80vw"
              format="webp" quality={90} decoding="async" />
          </div>
          <h3>{service.title}</h3>
          <p>{service.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="methodology-note reveal-up">
      <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#spark"/></svg>
      <p>Cinco caminhos para apoiar cada descoberta.<br><strong>Aprender, desenvolver e crescer com afeto.</strong></p>
      <Button variant="text" href="#contato">Vamos conversar sobre a aprendizagem? <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .methodology-heading { grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr; gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px); }
  .methodology-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 3.5vw, 54px); line-height: 1.2; }
  .methodology-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .methodology-card {
    position: relative; isolation: isolate; min-width: 0; padding: 24px 22px 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px #25213b03;
    transition: transform .5s var(--ease), box-shadow .5s, border-color .4s;
  }
  .methodology-card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 0%), var(--card-tint), transparent 75%);
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity .4s;
  }
  .methodology-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-accent) 35%, white); box-shadow: 0 16px 35px #25213b09; }
  .methodology-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .methodology-image { height: 190px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .methodology-image img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 0; object-fit: contain; transition: transform .7s var(--ease); }
  .methodology-image--blue img { height: 92%; }
  .methodology-card:hover .methodology-image img { transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(-2deg); }
  .methodology-card h3 { min-height: 2.8em; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  .methodology-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--muted); }
  .methodology-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .methodology-note > svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--brand-purple); }
  .methodology-note p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--muted); }
  .methodology-note strong { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .methodology-note :global(.text-link) { margin-left: auto; }
  @media (max-width: 1279px) {
    .methodology-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .methodology-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .methodology-heading > p { justify-self: start; max-width: 560px; }
    .methodology-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .methodology-note { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .methodology-note :global(.text-link) { margin-left: 46px; white-space: normal; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 599px) {
    .methodology-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 6.5vw, 34px); }
    .methodology-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .methodology-card { padding: 24px 26px 28px; }
    .methodology-image { height: 210px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .methodology-card h3 { min-height: 0; font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .methodology-card p { font-size: 14px; }
    .methodology-note p { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .methodology-card, .methodology-card::before, .methodology-image img { transition: none; }
    .methodology-card:hover, .methodology-card:hover .methodology-image img { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
